== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[fótur]]'' meaning "[[foot]]" + ''[[gangandi]]'' (meaning "[[walking]]", from ''[[ganga]]'' meanin "to [[walk]]". Literally meaning "walking by foot"
=== Adverb ===

'''fótgangandi'''

# [[by foot]]
#: ''Að fara '''fótgangandi'''.''
#:: To go '''by foot'''.

